{
 "id": "shabbat/maariv/vayechulu:sefard",
 "refs": {
  "Shabbat Siddur Sefard Linear, Maariv Service for Shabbos and Yom Tov, Vayechulu": {
   "edition": "metsudah-sefard-shabbat",
   "he": {
    "1": "וַיְכֻלּוּ הַשָּׁמַֽיִם וְהָאָֽרֶץ",
    "2": "וְכָל־צְבָאָם:",
    "3": "וַיְכַל אֱלֹהִים בַּיּוֹם הַשְּׁ֒בִיעִי",
    "4": "מְלַאכְתּוֹ אֲשֶׁר עָשָׂה.",
    "5": "וַיִּשְׁבֹּת בַּיּוֹם הַשְּׁ֒בִיעִי",
    "6": "מִכָּל־מְלַאכְתּוֹ אֲשֶׁר עָשָׂה:",
    "7": "וַיְבָֽרֶךְ אֱלֹהִים אֶת־יוֹם הַשְּׁ֒בִיעִי",
    "8": "וַיְקַדֵּשׁ אֹתוֹ.",
    "9": "כִּי בוֹ שָׁבַת",
    "10": "מִכָּל־מְלַאכְתּוֹ",
    "11": "אֲשֶׁר־בָּרָא אֱלֹהִים לַעֲשׂוֹת:"
   },
   "en": {
    "1": "And the heavens and the earth were completed",
    "2": "and [so were] all their hosts.",
    "3": "And God completed by the seventh day",
    "4": "His work which He had done,",
    "5": "and He abstained on the seventh day,",
    "6": "from all His work which He had done.",
    "7": "And God blessed the seventh day",
    "8": "and sanctified it",
    "9": "for on it He abstained",
    "10": "from all His work",
    "11": "which God had created to do."
   }
  }
 }
}
